  <name>XerahS</name>
  <summary>Capture, annotate, and share screenshots</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      XerahS captures a region of the screen through the desktop portal,
      lets you annotate it in a native image editor, and then saves, copies
      or uploads the result through saved capture workflows.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is the Qt 6 reference edition for Linux. It is Wayland first and
      asks for screenshot consent through xdg-desktop-portal.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.xerahs.app.desktop</launchable>
